  "text": "[Native text]\nINDEX NO. 654791/2018\nFILED: NEW YORK COUNTY CLERK 09/27/2018 04:16 PM \nNYSCEF DOC. NO. 1 \nRECEIVED NYSCEF: 09/27/2018 \n1 of 2 \nSUPREME COURT OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK \nCOUNTY OF NEW YORK \n-------------------------------------------------------x \nOPEHLLC, \n-against-\nMICHAEL E. BLEICH and \nALEXIS K. BLEICH, \nPlaintiff, \nIndex No. \nSUMMONS \nDefendants. \n-------------------------------------------------------x \nTO THE ABOVE NAMED DEFENDANTS: \nYou are hereby summoned and required to submit to Plaintiffs attorney your answering \npapers on this motion within the time provided in the notice of motion annexed hereto. In case of \nyour failure to submit answering papers, summary judgment will be taken against you by default \nfor the relief demanded in the notice of motion. \nThe basis of venue is Plaintiffs choice pursuant to CPLR §503. \nPLEASE TAKE FURTHER NOTICE that answering papers, if any, must be served on \nthe undersigned so that they are received no later than seven (7) days before the return date. \nDated: New York, New York \nSeptember 27, 2018 \nTARTER KRINSKY & DROGIN LLP \nAttorneys for Plaintiff \neffer, Esq. \nCathleen P. Cassidy, Esq. \n1350 Broadway \nNew York, New York 10018 \n(212) 216-8000\n\n[OCR alternative]\n(FILED: NEW YORK COUNTY CLERK 09/27/2018 04:16 PM INDEX NO. 654791/2018\nNYSCEF DOC. NO. 1 RECEIVED NYSCEF: 09/27/2018\n\nSUPREME COURT OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK\n\nCOUNTY OF NEW YORK\nOPEH LLC, °\nPlaintiff, Index No.\n-against- SUMMONS\nMICHAEL E. BLEICH and\nALEXIS K. BLEICH,\nDefendants.\nx\n\nTO THE ABOVE NAMED DEFENDANTS:\n\nYou are hereby summoned and required to submit to Plaintiffs attorney your answering\npapers on this motion within the time provided in the notice of motion annexed hereto. In case of\nyour failure to submit answering papers, summary judgment will be taken against you by default\nfor the relief demanded in the notice of motion.\n\nThe basis of venue is Plaintiff?s choice pursuant to CPLR §503.\n\nPLEASE TAKE FURTHER NOTICE that answering papers, if any, must be served on\nthe undersigned so that they are received no later than seven (7) days before the return date.\n\nDated: New York, New York\nSeptember 27, 2018\n\nTARTER KRINSKY & DROGIN LLP\nAttorneys for Plaintiff\n\nBy: CX\nDavid J. Pfeffer, Esq.\nCathleen P. Cassidy, Esq.\n1350 Broadway\n\nNew York, New York 10018\n(212) 216-8000\n\n1 of 2",
